@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/class-diagram
'subject
class PlayerData {
    int thoiGian
    int count
    int grade

    + void attach(IPlayerDataListener listener)
    '3 cái notify
    + void setThoiGian(int thoiGian)
    + void setDiemSo(int diemSo)
    + void setSoLuotChoi(int soLuotChoi)
    + void addEvent()

}

interface IPlayerDataListener {
    + void listen(PlayerData data)
}

' Observer
class Dashboard {
}

PlayerData --> IPlayerDataListener : listener
Dashboard --> PlayerData : playerData
Dashboard ..|> IPlayerDataListener

note right of PlayerData
- các setter là các notify
Ví dụ: setThoiGian(int thoiGian):
    thiết lập thoiGian:
        this.thoiGian = thoiGian

    neu listener khác null
    listen.listen(this)
end note
@enduml